		(property "Note2" "SOURCING 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S2-002) (B-71). Samtec BCS-112-S-D-HE is LCSC C5575816 with STOCK 0 at $15.54. It is a 24-contact through-hole strip and was already MANUAL/SECONDARY ASSEMBLY by CTO ruling at FBV2-S1-009; buy direct from Samtec or a broadline distributor. The connector architecture is NOT compromised for SMT assembly. LCSC/JLC library state verified live on 2026-08-23 through the JLCPCB parts API (D-096). Stock is a snapshot, not a guarantee."
			(at 120.65 140.97 0)
			(hide yes)
