			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Note" "Community XGPIO series protection, D-090. 100 Ohm between the exposed contact and the PCAL9535A `U3` port pin. It is a fault-current limiter, not a termination: at the PCAL 5.5 V absolute-maximum I/O rating a hostile 5 V applied to the contact is held to (5 - 3.3 - Vf)/100 = about 10 mA into the clamp, and an ESD event is handled by the TPD4E1B06 array before the resistor is reached. The 70 us-per-transition I2C latency of an expander pin makes the RC irrelevant: 100 Ohm into a 200 pF accessory is 20 ns."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
