		)
		(property "Note" "ACC_DETECT_N series protection, ADDED FBV2-S1-009. D-090 did not list this contact, which was an inconsistency: pin 23 is exposed and runs straight to a PCAL9535A input. 100 Ohm gives it the same fault-current limit as every other exposed signal for the cost of one 0603, and it is electrically free because the net is a static level behind a 100 kOhm pull-up (`R129`, sheet 08)."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
