		(property "Note" "WAKE series protection, D-090. 330 Ohm rather than 100 Ohm because this contact reaches the SHARED interrupt line: a hostile accessory that forces the pin can otherwise starve the buttons. It sits between the contact and the SOURCE of the `Q10` isolation gate, so the FET sees a limited current under abuse. See the WAKE ISOLATION note."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
