		(property "Note_Sourcing" "SOURCING D-614. EXACT_PRIOR from the beta-dm audit line '100nF X7R' (ACCEPTED); manufacturer derived from the YAGEO part-number family and corroborated by the audit text; dielectric X7R meets X7R."
			(at 215.9 86.36 0)
