				)
			)
		)
		(property "Note" "TCA4307 local decoupling, FBV2-S1-009. 100 nF X7R 0603 against pin 8 with the shortest possible return to pin 4. The part draws only 2.5 mA typical, but it switches rise-time accelerators that source 2-5 mA in tens of nanoseconds, and it is the device that has to behave correctly during a live insertion transient - which is exactly when the local rail is worst."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
